WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.767
-It's time for "Tonight Show
Stocking Stuffers"!

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:03.767
Here we go!

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:06.801
♪ It's "The Tonight Show" ♪

00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:08.767
♪ It's "The Tonight Show" ♪

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:09.901
-♪ Stocking stuffers ♪

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:13.701
-♪ Stocking stuffers ♪

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:17.868
-Now, there is no need to check
under your seats for this one.

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:19.734
Every night
until Christmas break,

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:21.534
we're giving away
an awesome gift

00:00:21.534 --> 00:00:25.334
to every single person
in our studio audience.

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:27.934
You guys excited?
You guys ready?

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:29.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:34.367
You guys want to see what you're
going to take home tonight?

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.534
Quest, can I get
a drumroll, please?

00:00:36.534 --> 00:00:41.300
[ Drumroll ]
Tonight's stocking stuffer is...

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:46.567
a Nintendo Switch,
OLED-model system,

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:47.934
"Splatoon 3" game,

00:00:47.934 --> 00:00:51.968
and a 3-month subscription to
Nintendo Switch online.

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:53.234
-That's right, Jimmy.

00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:56.400
This holiday, splat the halls
with "Splatoon 3,"

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.667
the new game from Nintendo
where you compete with friends

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:00.133
and splash the most ink.

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:02.601
Play on your TV
or handheld or tabletop

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:04.901
with the Nintendo Switch
OLED mode.

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:05.901
Who knows?

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:07.234
You may even get
splatted by Jimmy

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:10.501
when he's playing online,
via Nintendo Switch online,

00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:12.868
which means you'll all get,
for free for three months,

00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:14.701
so much fun.

00:01:14.701 --> 00:01:16.467
Jimmy?

00:01:16.467 --> 00:01:18.901
-Thank you!

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:21.334
Thank you to our friends
at Nintendo.

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:22.801
Enjoy your gift, guys.

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:25.000
We'll be right back with
Kate Hudson!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.200
Congratulations!

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.200
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

